# Disallow can counter a triggered ability (CR 115.1, 701.6). Bot2 casts Thraben Inspector; after it resolves,
# its mandatory enters trigger is on the stack (Bot1 passes once). Bot1 flashes in Disallow off Black Lotus and
# targets that trigger, so no Clue token is created. The Inspector itself stays on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Disallow
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Thraben Inspector
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thraben Inspector.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Disallow.Cast(Stack.Thraben Inspector)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield = Plains; Thraben Inspector
